  "description": "MCP server for GroupDocs.Editor — edit Word, Excel, PowerPoint and PDF via HTML round-trip with AI agents. Replace text without losing formatting, turn a document (or one worksheet, slide or PDF page range) into editable HTML and save it back to DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, PDF, TXT, Markdown or EPUB, and fill Word form fields — locally, documents never leave the machine. Exposes GetDocumentInfo, ExtractHtml, SaveFromHtml, ReplaceText, GetSupportedFormats, GetFormFields and FillFormFields to AI agents.",
